        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🎭 Thronebreaker: A Game of Choices and Consequences</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a world where every choice echoes through time.<br>In the royal court, love can be a weapon, loyalty a curse, and betrayal the only truth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Thronebreaker</strong> offers a story filled with <strong>intrigue, romance, and moral dilemmas</strong>, brought to life through cinematic visuals and branching narratives.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >⚔️ Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🕯️ <strong>Deep Political Intrigue</strong> – Every chapter unfolds secrets, betrayals, and shifting loyalties.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >💔 <strong>Romantic Relationships</strong> – Love blooms amidst danger, but every heart comes with a cost.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🧭 <strong>Every Choice Matters</strong> – Each chapter features at least one major decision that shapes your destiny.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎨 <strong>Rich Visual Storytelling</strong> – Realistic and immersive scenes bring the kingdom to life.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⏳ <strong>Long Playtime</strong> – Multiple storylines, side characters, and unique endings.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >👑 <strong>Diverse Cast of Characters</strong> – Each with their own motives, stories, and secrets.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your reign begins now.<br>Will you rule through <strong>love or fear</strong>?</p>",
